"name":"不死鳥","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115402","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"神月 社","creatorId":"vndb:s4003","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4003","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4003","name":"神月 社","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115403","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"B.J","creatorId":"vndb:s4400","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4400","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4400","name":"B.J","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115404","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"TETU","creatorId":"vndb:s9711","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9711","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9711","name":"TETU","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115405","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"KEN-ZO","creatorId":"vndb:s9713","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9713","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9713","name":"KEN-ZO","roleCode":"director","roleLabel":"导演","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115406","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"元町 神戸屋","creatorId":"vndb:s12582","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s12582","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s12582","name":"元町神戸屋","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:115408","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31698","characterName":"六道 あさひ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31698"},"originalCharacterName":"六道 あさひ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A unique girl facing trials on her way to the Land of Dreams"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Student (First National School for Higher Magic Education, 9th Class, Caster)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mage who attends the Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"In contrast to her young appearance, she has a dynamism and decisiveness to put the average adult to shame. She’s well-known at the Academy for causing commotions. She has her own set of values and is treated as an oddball by those around her for it, but that doesn’t bother her at all. Because of her cute appearance and odd behavior, she’s got a cult following among the boys of the Academy. She’s a strong person who never doubts herself, but she’s also got an unusually pure heart, and sometimes misses her family, whom she can no longer see."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She believes in the existence of a ”Land of Dreams” and has made reaching it her ultimate goal. She believes that trials she must overcome to reach this land are recorded in the diary she’s always carrying around."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I won’t be asking you for help. These are my trials, after all.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31698"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e6/e69a3fcb4f45ad23544e643a58c51cf54573a8d289cddfcacab5f5ce93b67513.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/97/97dd00935877194fe03ea7601e68e7230ccefeebbffcd0d7ed0a638cb3fbcb0e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"香山 いちご","creatorId":"vndb:s809","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s809","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s809","name":"山口 絵","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61683","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31699","characterName":"逢鳥 凛久","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31699"},"originalCharacterName":"逢鳥 凛久","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of a huge company’s CEO, who’s not quite on the same wavelength as others her age"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Student (First National School for Higher Magic Education, 10th Class, Caster)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The daughter of Atori, the company that manufactures Magi-related goods. She’s a tester of the products Atori develops, specifically of first-rate goods. Since she’s been continually surrounded by adults from a young age, she doesn’t have much in common with other teenagers and her tastes are like those of an old man."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn’t let anything bother her and she has a tendency to be logical about things, so she’s more composed than Haruto even though he’s older than her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She doesn’t have any friends at the Academy, but she’s casual with the people she’s close to. Of course, that’s pretty much just one person: Akeno, an employee at Atori."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Well, if they don’t need to do anything, that’s probably for the best.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31699"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b4641ebf475d7722348082d76d5efeb8f7619e074ad05dbae8619c6f9a50e42.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6e/6e1b094d18b7fd8eef5e349ced17c3f7d9ce03edf736e0f29872e53067e0f272.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青葉 りんご","creatorId":"vndb:s295","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s295","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s295","name":"青葉 りんご","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61679","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31700","characterName":"神前・フィオナ・アンナベル","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31700"},"originalCharacterName":"神前・フィオナ・アンナベル","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The moral center of the local church, her smile never goes out"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Apprentice Sister"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A sister with a beautiful smile who works at the church."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s meek and cheerful and works hard. She takes care of all of the clerical work by herself and is always busy with something or other. Not only do all the parishioners love her, she’s on good terms with the vigilantes who hang around the church too."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Father Gaimon appreciates the natural, calming effect she has on her surroundings, but she can also be a little immature at times. The melancholic smiles she sometimes lets slip have stolen many a heart. She’s fond of sweet things and cats (particularly their paw pads)."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Let’s do our best again today!\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31700"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fa/fa1af76840bd3ab8426247010ab87ba21e02e7d03c961b5b3cccbea3ca8d0769.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b671721fb1474edfc22f955f5f0e7b9f64e56d907e1db8125e12f524f1c33cab.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桃井 穂美","creatorId":"vndb:s263","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s263","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s263","name":"儀武 ゆう子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61681","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c31701","characterName":"ノア","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c31701"},"originalCharacterName":"ノア","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl spotted on Agartha"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Unknown"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A supernatural phenomenon that’s constantly the topic of discussion on occult message boards. Since she only appears during the frequent power outages, there are rumors that she’s the vengeful spirit of someone who was electrocuted on a power line, but no one knows the real truth. She isn’t something just based on mere rumor; more photographical proof and witness testimonies lending credence to her existence are surfacing every day."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\".........\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c31701"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86f6c740f19211198ff6061b4c4e1da11e8ee0043a538cc63baca1c7b7e1cc97.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/e2/e2ad72f743cedba5d290ac09fbf46683e4fb1625ed54b60839c32aae31cb81d8.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"杏 花","creatorId":"vndb:s869","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s869","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s869","name":"設楽 麻美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61685","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c33530","characterName":"陸壬 陽斗","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c33530"},"originalCharacterName":"陸壬 陽斗","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Slightly half-baked, a boy who can’t turn a blind eye to wrongdoing"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: Student (First National School for Higher Magic Education, 9th Class, Caster)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mage in his second year at the Academy. He’s cheerful, upbeat, and honest, so people tend to like him, even if he can be a bit oblivious at times. He has a strong sense of justice and he can’t walk away when he sees someone doing something wrong."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He gets involved in incidents most often when it looks like people are going to get hurt, which gets him in trouble with his father Yuuji, a detective."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since they lost their mother early in life, he and his sister split the housework. His best dish is omelette rice, and he always writes the recipient’s name on it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"That’s not right. It’s not playing fair.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Original Amabuki Senri's Clone"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5faaa2de42e9dfd73c763f877cb5008800c0678784d291bf488d91d019acfacf.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/efba46d7c7858ce724749dcf40e4d3c5e80bd3e133fa716bb575d279c202d8e7.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ますおか ゆうじ","creatorId":"vndb:s1822","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1822","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1822","name":"増田 雄市","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61687","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c33531","characterName":"センリ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c33531"},"originalCharacterName":"センリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An anonymous inhabitant of the city’s nightlife"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Occupation: OutCast"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious young man who operates near the entertainment district. He has many casual acquaintances and could be called sociable. When he finds time, he attempts to solve extremely difficult ring puzzles, and has a habit of only looking at things from a logical point of view."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ageha, an information broker, values his skills as a mage and sometimes has him take care of not-so-legal troubles."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has something of an elusive air, as he pays no attention to matters that don’t interest him and is always extremely frank. When he judges something to be worthwhile, however, he’ll show unusual tenacity and decisiveness in pursuing it."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"I don’t imagine I’ll be able to make anything of that.\""},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From MangaGamer"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"His real name is Amabuki Tsumugu."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c33531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8b/8bf1e412902b3dec2b3ec60ea106377e158c02612ec75b40b61d910d43b80271.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/70/7075cb1794255a80c6df82d15ed494c27c7a0267a4554e7f94ac254d5097cb29.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"やじま のぼる","creatorId":"vndb:s4816","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s4816","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s4816","name":"やじまのぼる","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61691","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35046","characterName":"ルゥ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35046"},"originalCharacterName":"ルゥ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who naturally seems to get herself into trouble."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's been pestering Senri ever since he saved her once, though she hasn't realized that her attention is bothering him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems unaware of the danger inherent in walking around alone at nights, perhaps because she's had a sheltered upbringing, or perhaps because she's simply not too bright."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While seemingly a powerless girl, unable to use magic, no matter how much trouble she gets in, she strangely always comes out of it smiling, with not a scratch on her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35046"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9c/9cde2ac5e129a1d3927583f6eafe061066b88797c209e1624c5e555b3a216f84.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f5/f5b9de6245f13450b43c83ad80cd7a3a768aa71133ecf4f3ccffd74e9c24c8b0.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"沢澤 砂羽","creatorId":"vndb:s196","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s196","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s196","name":"種﨑 敦美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61688","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35047","characterName":"アゲハ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35047"},"originalCharacterName":"アゲハ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Senri's landlady. She rents him the apartment he uses."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Once a delinquent student at the Academy, she dropped out and ended up settling down in the entertainment district."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She holds abundant connections and offers the (completely unlicensed) get-rich-quick type of work to OutCasts."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She stays so true to her creed of \"live free and have fun\" that everyone around her, herself included, recognizes her as a failure of a human being."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The high income she receives (with little effort) for her work mediation only encourages this self-indulgence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She loses interest in things just as quickly as she gains it, and will invest a great deal into a hobby only to abandon it the next day."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35047"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7a/7a9d45cd322cb0c5e845bb4094f8246f2e78bce4a6651b27f85477f48f44a42f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a3/a3be969368d678c5e7eb7d85feed93cb4e49691c4e1e8feeca75a8f0d3761785.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"桃井 いちご","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61680","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35048","characterName":"國立 暁","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35048"},"originalCharacterName":"國立 暁","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruto's classmate at the Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's cheerful and sociable, with many friends and acquaintances."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Unlike Haruto, who can't see what's going on around him when he's focused on a task, Akatsuki is the type to calmly analyze all his surroundings before taking action."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, he ends up helping Haruto out anyway, so he doesn't really do much to keep him in check."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He calls himself Haruto's sidekick, treating his friend like a superhero at every opportunity."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The nickname he's given Haruto is \"Super Haruto\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35048"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/cc/ccacba7c25e3a76dc56d77f95032e40e649e5530b2d94fcfbc88f808b1e0841f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd8b797d8e82713e732f4d4358b680c49d671da06d86711e1bc371477b3db22e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"はしもと ゆう","creatorId":"vndb:s5524","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s5524","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s5524","name":"はしもと ゆう","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61689","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35049","characterName":"御来屋 朱乃","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35049"},"originalCharacterName":"御来屋 朱乃","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"An elite employee at Atori Inc."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's foul-mouthed and often arrogant, but is a capable woman who's in charge of a whole branch despite her youth."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She won't hesitate to skirt the law for the purpose of achieving her goals, and most problems that arise she can simply destroy, through either money or her connections."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She interacts with Riku a great deal and tends to talk down to her, but since Riku kind of acts the same way, they get along fine."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35049"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7d/7d3545a9f931e0fe130f927ff2101ba613b0ce8d4f85b92ef0ef43c3aad259c4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/77/77e94fa6368647f9588d4f32f9e7723aaa4797fc46ea183ece0389fe7f0f135b.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"かわしま りの","creatorId":"vndb:s28","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s28","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s28","name":"瑞沢 渓","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61675","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35050","characterName":"ミキヒサ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35050"},"originalCharacterName":"ミキヒサ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The leader of the vigilantes operating in the entertainment district."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no talent for magic and can't adapt to magical society."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no particular goals, either, and simply wastes his days away, refusing to become a cog in the machine society."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's utterly outrageous how, using his unusual strength, he vents his frustrations on whomever he decides he dislikes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There is however, a certain charisma in that overwhelming destructive power, for which many of the vigilantes look up to him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Senri once trounced him like it was nothing, and for that he now holds a grudge against him."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35050"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/42/4252f46aa42b52e4b0be2ea3f45b886bf4083746b44b574a2bdcb994b56fe98f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d7/d7166930df1ed24af0900563ff2dce2856f002e3e558995bb9e7bfae15d4d2a9.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"水樹 空","creatorId":"vndb:s1093","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1093","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1093","name":"水樹空","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61686","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35051","characterName":"エトー","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35051"},"originalCharacterName":"エトー","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The proprietor of a warehouse that sells Magi junk."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It might just be his personality, but he can always be seen with his chin in his hand, looking bored, as he tends to the store."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's so committed to his unsociable attitude that he's never even welcomed a customer."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A store known for ignoring customers who ask what a product is could never possibly flourish, so he's been having financial difficulties."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"There might be a reason other than sales for why his store has managed to survive."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35051"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad3d1af5c03d61093d2c06ce907637c9d36caa2f1f03209e10e8a366f85acae7.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/88/883051c38eeb3fb2e552c5876623e8a99d75ed55a72c07796c28ba8b14f61d4e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"犬飼 正流","creatorId":"vndb:s37471","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s37471","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s37471","name":"犬飼 正流","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61694","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35052","characterName":"概紋 神父","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35052"},"originalCharacterName":"概紋 神父","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The priest of the church, who truly believes in \"saving the weak\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He lends the church to Mikihisa and his hoodlums in an attempt to get them to grow a little and understand his way of thinking."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Their vigilante activities are supposed to reform them some as well, but they don't quite seem to understand that."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"His physique, cultivated from his days as a police officer in the juvenile division, is proof of the depth of his character and his accepting nature."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35052"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7ec52ada1d0c94206d6d03734d520ca9f71d6e6e6c1bf811c1fa8ce66f40ecd2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fd/fdb5c78c8de1d21bee009ed838ac717e1320d159cffbb9b6848950cdf6b10638.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"乙参","creatorId":"vndb:s9501","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s9501","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s9501","name":"藤沼 建人","rol