st as kind as she is strict."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Blessed with incredible magic talent, she graduated early from the Academy and now works there as a lecturer, while also lending her skills to BURST (the Bureau of Unregistered magic Regulation and Suppressive Tactics) in times of emergency."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Since she's close in age to the students of the Academy, many of them come to her for advice on various topics."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35054"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/11/116fbc10835310158c68b070e94588e89172a3bcfee30f777a0a02354dafda98.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c93b9295901ed9583e8eec2bc8f6819a12a2e6e50d1e0b2a91eefa65ff270705.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"御苑生 メイ","creatorId":"vndb:s278","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s278","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s278","name":"小山 さほみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61678","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35055","characterName":"戌亥 尚央","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35055"},"originalCharacterName":"戌亥 尚央","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Academy's headmaster and one of its founders. He's an influential man, famous for his extraordinary magical prowess and his clout with some of the country's leaders."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Inui is also a man of character, who lives an exemplary life without letting the extravagance of his position blind him."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Thirdly, he's quite popular, with a not-inconsiderable amount of admires."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Some have witnessed him taking the time to encourage students he runs across."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has reaped the benefits of a healthy lifestyle, as he shows few signs of aging even after his sixtieth birthday."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35055"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/71/713db86e127d9591501508c664e538eb33fd3f99a3493e28873c733c3122d1a0.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d5/d55f22df8e6b73df3410ec788090b4ed6910aa508a57d8e09c70025e68f1515c.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一条 和矢","creatorId":"vndb:s256","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s256","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s256","name":"一条 和矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61677","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35056","characterName":"紙館 栞子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35056"},"originalCharacterName":"紙館 栞子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A freelance reporter who makes a living working for an irresponsible gossip magazine."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Her devotion to gathering information is fierce, and to obtain a new scoop, she'll follow a lead no matter when or where."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"While the articles she writes are third-rate, she's always 100% serious when she talks to people, with no fooling around whatsoever."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's interested in magical incidents and accidents and has a habit of spewing off baseless conspiracy theories in order to string together the information she's gathered."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She suffers from a chronic lack of sleep because of the work she does, but she doesn't let this bother her."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35056"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/60/60471b4e44cc4fc7332d10f6bff2f7512703eb17d08542bb63aa7d0cc5123890.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2f/2f34799142da60632fe7753456a5f0f44087c16e8216c541067e2153ef138ff5.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"手塚 りょうこ","creatorId":"vndb:s646","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s646","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s646","name":"立石 めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61682","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35057","characterName":"睦壬 緋奈","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35057"},"originalCharacterName":"睦壬 緋奈","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Haruto's collected and dependable little sister."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She and Haruto split the cooking and chores, but she genuinely enjoys doing both."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She seems a bit slow from the singsongy way she speaks, but she's good with her hands and has no particular flaws besides."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It's part of Hina's daily routine to wake Haruto up, but sometimes she forgets her duty and starts sleeping alongside him instead."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She is a clone of Mikuriya Hina."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35057"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/41/4191b91f2abce67b8fd8617cbf1ff035091497a625a0c1532373cf6bfe5aad9d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e455863ce4bccfb54ecaeac7c9853be2d97014e6ee7c60a2fbbc365fb0eeb90.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"綾瀬 あかり","creatorId":"vndb:s601","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s601","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s601","name":"松平 美波穂","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61693","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35058","characterName":"睦壬 悠司","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35058"},"originalCharacterName":"睦壬 悠司","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A commander of BURST (the Bureau of Unregistered magic Regulation and Suppressive Tactics), which was established to deal with magic crimes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's quite serious and rather hot-blooded when it comes to his job, and spends all day and night working on cases."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's harsh with Haruto when his son is reckless, but he displays a gentle, fatherly side when the two of them play catch together."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has several faults however, including being careless with housework and always returning home late from his job."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35058"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d3/d33033a2b31333803fbc3a4c4b90f91d9e8d8881639a8fa7ea28e74bc008a233.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/57/57e0abf85039cbf4e67b57a2ccdff9e5cf164fa31684d4f3b54f1281a4b69036.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"咲久間 匠","creatorId":"vndb:s6759","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6759","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6759","name":"嵜本 正和","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61690","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c35059","characterName":"フード","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c35059"},"originalCharacterName":"フード","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Age: unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Gender: unknown."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A mysterious being hiding its entire body with a hood and cloak."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"It handed Etoh a huge number of Rings, then disappeared."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Senri appears to be very interested in this \"Hood\"."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c35059"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8d/8dd422f169bfd4fb3192123bd854b48ee8c3ff7204aca1e5c05a65f5d6cf1205.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1b/1bca21ac621963b2e5ac1f4bf99f1ee818284c04514ce32ae3434251ecaa9cd6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c65333","characterName":"六道 灯夜","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c65333"},"originalCharacterName":"六道 灯夜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"A former researcher working on a top-secret government project related to magic."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As Asahi's brother, Touya was supposed to have died eight years ago in the \"Fall of Icaruc\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's an elitist, and believes himself to be a special and chosen person."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After faking his death, he used Ruu to steadily carry out his plan to cause a new \"Holy War\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"When his preparations were complete, he was captured by Haruto as a nameless OutCast and imprisoned in the magical criminal detention facility."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He's blessed with outstanding intellect and always makes reasoned judgments, but he will occasionally take actions that can't be said to be necessary for his plans."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"As he says, it's all so that he can \"know whether fate has chosen him;\" Touya wants to prove that he's one of the chosen by overcoming obstacles in his path."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He has no scruples about using other people, and in the past, he heartlessly drove a girl to brain death in order to perform an experiment on magic aptitude."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c65333"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3a/3a566cd158bc12b57dce7044f960eff4015e171d6f6ce5145751f98bf2a23e78.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/50/50e1879ea26995ac79cb2f96418409f36614006896903b16b45c5f5af36f775e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"野☆球","creatorId":"vndb:s837","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s837","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s837","name":"景浦 大輔","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:61684","source":"vndb"}]}],"songs":[],"companies":[{"companyId":"vndb:p1649","sourceCompanyId":"egs:brand:3065","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p1649","name":"3rdEye","roleCodes":["brand"],"identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"egs:work-brand:21180:3065","source":"egs"},{"companyId":"vndb:p26576","sourceCompanyId":"vndb:p26576","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:p26576","name":"未来視汉化组","roleCodes":["publisher"],"identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:release-producer:122960:v16337","source":"vndb"},